# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Belt and braces. None of these should ever exist in the public repository —
# the licence signing key, the issuance tool, the customer ledger, the release
# runbook, and the commercial strategy dossier live only on the private side.
# .github/workflows/guard.yml fails the build if one arrives anyway; this stops
# it being committed in the first place.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
tools/.keys/
tools/.issued.tsv
tools/issue_license.py
PUBLISHING.md
docs/design/11-commercial.md
*.pem
*_ed25519
id_rsa*
.env
.env.*

# A stranger's text, verbatim, awaiting a human. The permanent record of what
# arrived and what happened to it is the ledger, not the bytes.
harvest/staging/
harvest/quarantine/
